# W1-D keeps everything. Nothing here is ignored.
#
# Tracked as evidence, exactly as the tools leave them:
#   runs/K*/work_definition.json   the agent artifact, where one is produced
#   runs/K*/acp_transcript.jsonl   append-only ACP transcript + lifecycle records
#   runs/K*/harness_result.json    outcome, reason, per-turn log with what was sent,
#                                  pre-run filesystem snapshot, controlled hashes
#   RESULTS.md / RESULTS.json      the STRUCTURAL grader's record   (primary)
#   FIDELITY.md / FIDELITY.json    the FIDELITY gate's record       (primary)
#   A4_SHADOW.md / A4_SHADOW.json  the descriptive shadow audit     (NOT a verdict)
